      "sut_name": "burgers-1d",
      "display_name": "1D Burgers — MeshRefinement (mass conservation)",
      "description": "Mass conservation MP_inv: the conservative Lax-Friedrichs flux differencing with periodic boundaries preserves ∫u dx exactly per step regardless of the shock structure. Doubling num_points changes the initial Gaussian sampling by O(dx²) but per-step mass conservation is exact; the final mass_integral must agree within tight FD tolerance.",
